WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:25.880
Zippy drove very fast.

2
00:00:25.881 --> 00:00:29.257
But he didn't hit the cones.

3
00:00:29.258 --> 00:00:38.870
And he stopped at the sign.

4
00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:43.134
"Good job, Zippy," said Ms. Fender.

5
00:00:43.135 --> 00:00:46.267
"But next time go slow."

6
00:00:46.268 --> 00:00:49.202
"Sorry," said Zippy.

7
00:00:49.203 --> 00:00:52.128
"I'm just too fast!"

8
00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:54.425
Eddy frowned.

9
00:00:54.426 --> 00:00:56.685
Poppy went next.

10
00:00:56.686 --> 00:01:04.500
Honk! Honk!

11
00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:07.827
Poppy knocked over a cone.

12
00:01:07.828 --> 00:01:12.961
"Whee!" she cried.

13
00:01:12.962 --> 00:01:17.292
"Stop being silly, Poppy!" said Ms. Fender.

14
00:01:17.293 --> 00:01:21.749
"Sorry!" said Poppy.

15
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:26.302
"La, la, la, la!" Poppy sang.

16
00:01:26.303 --> 00:01:30.546
She drove past the stop sign.

17
00:01:30.547 --> 00:01:34.671
"You didn't stop!" cried Ms. Fender.

18
00:01:34.672 --> 00:01:39.004
"Sorry!" said Poppy.

19
00:01:39.005 --> 00:01:43.174
Then it was Eddy's turn.

20
00:01:43.175 --> 00:01:46.960
"Remember, Eddy," said Ms. Fender.

21
00:01:46.961 --> 00:01:50.256
"Don't go too fast."

22
00:01:50.257 --> 00:01:52.721
Zippy laughed.

23
00:01:52.722 --> 00:01:55.047
"Don't worry, Ms. Fender.

24
00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:59.418
Eddy won't go too fast!"

25
00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:04.417
Eddy's engine roared.
